's the best time to work hard with no interruptions. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 2}, {"text": "", "correct": true, "_data": [{"content": "Suddenly, the lights went off!", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 3}, {"text": "", "correct": true, "_data": [{"content": "I was going to check what had happened", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 4}, {"text": "", "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "but then", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 5}, {"text": "", "correct": true, "_data": [{"content": "the door of my office closed by itself", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 6}, {"text": "", "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "and", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 7}, {"text": "", "correct": true, "_data": [{"content": "I heard a cat mewing in the dark", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 8}, {"text": "", "correct": true, "_data": [{"content": "Then, I woke up.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 9}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nRoger has the same experience every night!\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Read the text and select all the sentences that refer to actions that happened in the past.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 9, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le17ob03re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nResearch a superstition.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le17ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Vanessa, I'm at my wit's end!\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter, what's wrong?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I've lost a really important file. I was working on a file that was saved on my desktop. Suddenly, it disappeared! I swear that there's something really strange going on. First my phone, now my computer. There's a bigger power at work here.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Are you sure it's not just a coincidence that they are both having problems at the same time?", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le17ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I really believe that there's more to it than just a coincidence. Do you believe in superstitions? Do you believe that some of our actions can bring us bad luck?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, not really. Although I do throw salt over my shoulder if I spill it on the table, and I don't open my umbrella inside. But I'm not scared of black cats! I tend to follow the superstitions that are just common sense, like \u201cdon't walk under a ladder.\u201d Anyway, let's figure out your computer.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Okay. Do you have any ideas of what might have happened? I was saving the document to my hard drive regularly and backing up my files to an external hard drive too. But somehow I deleted this document.", "time": "27000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did you save it to a memory stick?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, I didn't.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did you do a search on your computer for the missing file?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, I did that. I found all the other files that I had saved. I unplugged the modem and plugged it back in.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It is really strange that the file disappeared. Maybe we should take your phone and your laptop into the repair shop. I'll come with you.", "time": "70000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}